{"id":"marxism-p018","bookId":"marxism","number":18,"title":"知识点16商品的价值量","width":1190.55,"height":841.89,"image":"data/knowledge/pages/marxism/marxism-p018.svg","dataUrl":"data/knowledge/pages/marxism/marxism-p018.json","questionCount":14,"version":1,"imagePixels":[2084,1474],"source":{"file":"27上岸村·马原理论思维导图.pdf","sha256":"ea74dfb02d0d04582b14c3652a4c6a144be801f9cdcb91ab7eb4398a1284da05","page":18},"nodes":[{"id":"marxism-p018-n0001","text":"知识点","bbox":[60.942,518.853,46.679,15.56],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.56,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0002","text":"16","bbox":[107.621,511.998,23.339,15.56],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.56,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0003","text":"商品的价值量","bbox":[130.96,518.853,93.358,15.56],"color":"#141414","fontSize":15.56,"block":0,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0004","text":"一、商品的价值量","bbox":[274.022,342.411,110.646,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":1,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0005","text":"1.","bbox":[417.516,203.033,8.962,13.831],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.831,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0006","text":"商品价值量的含义及决定因素","bbox":[426.477,208.21,179.8,13.831],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.831,"block":2,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0007","text":"商品的价值量是指商品价值的大小","bbox":[666.758,108.801,207.461,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":3,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0008","text":"商品的价值是凝结在商品中的无差别的一般人类劳动","bbox":[666.758,148.565,318.107,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":4,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0009","text":"价值量由劳动者生产商品所耗费的劳动量决定，而劳动量则按照劳动时间计算","bbox":[666.758,188.328,470.245,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":5,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0010","text":"决定商品价值量的不是生产商品的个别劳动时间，而是","bbox":[666.758,228.092,331.938,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0011","text":"社会必要劳动时间","bbox":[998.696,228.092,110.646,13.831],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.831,"block":6,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0012","text":"社会必要劳动时间是指","bbox":[666.758,307.618,138.308,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":7,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0013","text":"在现有的社会正常的生产条件下","bbox":[837.913,267.855,193.631,13.831],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.831,"block":8,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0014","text":"在社会平均的劳动熟练程度和劳动强度下","bbox":[837.913,307.618,248.954,13.831],"color":"#8e24aa","fontSize":13.831,"block":9,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0015","text":"生产某种商品所需要的劳动时间","bbox":[837.913,347.382,193.631,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":10,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0016","text":"2.","bbox":[417.516,471.436,11.106,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0017","text":"商品的价值量与劳动生产率","bbox":[428.632,476.613,165.969,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":11,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0018","text":"劳动生产率","bbox":[627.57,426.909,69.154,13.831],"color":"#19a719","fontSize":13.831,"block":12,"line":0,"emphasis":true,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0019","text":"指的是劳动者生产使用价值的效率","bbox":[729.572,387.145,207.461,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":13,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-n0020","text":"它的高低可以用单位劳动时间内生产商品的","bbox":[729.572,426.909,262.784,13.831],"color":"#141414","fontSize":13.831,"block":14,"line":0,"emphasis":false,"role":"content"},{"id":"marxism-p018-